stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> inactive: unit file in /etc/systemd/system
  inactive --> activating: systemctl start / boot (enabled)
  activating --> active: ExecStart running
  active --> deactivating: systemctl stop
  deactivating --> inactive
  active --> auto_restart: crash (non-zero exit / signal)
  auto_restart --> activating: after RestartSec
  auto_restart --> failed: StartLimitBurst exceeded
  failed --> activating: systemctl restart (after fix)
